{"version":1,"content":"<p>【天啊 😱】知名科技評測頻道《PhoneBuff》日前釋出 Apple 首款摺疊機 iPhone Duo 的耐摔跌落測試（Drop Test）結果，在鉸鏈首輪跌落撞擊後，鉸鏈機構便出現卡死狀況，導致機身無法完全展開平整，並且在第二次跌落後內螢幕已經出現漏液，四次後右半側觸控全面失效。</p><p>但好消息的是，它可以當作一部普通 iPhone 使用。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.489235+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:13:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:01.174316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.538238+00:00","content_hash":"809b4390b64f20613b04436f44d7d95a91f2a1881ab7039db84f359d7dac24ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}